[wizard]
install_title="Set management password"
install_help="<b>First installation or application data removed</b><br>Set the management password used to sign in to Motrix. Use 8–128 characters and enter the same password twice.<br><br><b>Reinstalling with application data retained</b><br>Leave both fields empty and click Next. Installation checks and reuses the saved management password; entries on this page will not change it. If the retained data has no password configured, you must enter one."
password_label="Management password"
password_length="The management password must contain 8–128 characters"
password_confirm_label="Confirm management password"
upgrade_title="Upgrade information and confirmation"
upgrade_compatibility_help="<b>1.x tasks and resume state are incompatible</b><br>2.x uses a new download engine. It does not import or continue 1.x tasks and cannot use their resume progress, session or engine state. After upgrading, 1.x tasks will no longer appear. Complete any downloads whose progress you need in the old version first, including tasks you want to restore from the recycle bin."
upgrade_backup_help="<b>Files are retained; back up before upgrading</b><br>Downloaded files and old task state remain in place. The management password, settings, folder authorizations and RPC tokens are retained. Keeping old data does not allow the new version to restore old tasks. The app does not automatically back up or migrate old tasks.<br><br>To roll back, restore both the matching old package and a complete application data backup made before upgrading. Do not let 1.x read data from the new version directly."
upgrade_ack_label="Upgrade confirmation"
upgrade_ack_option="I have read and agree to the compatibility and backup information above"
upgrade_ack_required="Read and agree to the upgrade information before continuing"
uninstall_title="Application data on uninstall"
uninstall_keep_help="By default, uninstalling retains Motrix application data so it can be reused after reinstalling or upgrading."
uninstall_delete_label="Also delete Motrix application data"
uninstall_delete_help="Deletes private application data, including task records, settings, JSON-RPC tokens, the Aria2 session and logs. Files in your download folders will not be deleted."
